      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "targets": [],
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### DataLite Pipeline Flow\n`S3 incoming .zip` \u2192 `SQS incoming-files` \u2192 `ECS DataAcquisition task` \u2192 `Stage` \u2192 `Process` \u2192 `Reconcile` \u2192 `Target/Master tables`\n\n### Common Investigation Flow\n1. **Job not starting:** Check S3 file, SQS queue depth/oldest age, ECS service health, and startup errors.\n2. **Record count mismatch:** Download ZIP, compare `.properties` expected counts to CSV actual counts.\n3. **Volume exceeded:** Job becomes **STOPPED**, not **FAILED**. Validate source volume, then restart from Compass UI if acceptable.\n4. **Unknown organizations:** Check `CHANGED='S'`, ABA format, and whether organization exists in Compass.\n5. **Long running job:** Check step durations, database performance, slow queries, and input volume.\n6. **DLQ > 0:** Critical. Message is stuck and job is not processing normally.\n"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "transformations": []
    }
